      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chester_Heights%2C_Pennsylvania",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The borough’s name echoes its Swedish roots, as settlers found rich soil inland from the Delaware River before William Penn’s grants.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2,
