      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chester_Heights%2C_Pennsylvania",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Chester Heights incorporated as a borough on September 21, 1945, separating from Aston Township.",
